## 🖥️ 3. Bare-Metal / VPS Deployment (with PM2)

If deploying to an Ubuntu/Debian VPS:

1. Install Node.js 20+ and PM2:
   ```bash
   sudo npm install -g pm2
   ```

2. Clone repository and install dependencies:
   ```bash
   git clone <repo-url>
   cd <%= projectName %>
   npm ci
   npm run build
   ```

3. Start application with PM2:
   ```bash
   pm2 start dist/index.js --name "<%= projectName %>" -i max
   pm2 save
   pm2 startup
   ```

4. Set up an **Nginx** reverse proxy to forward traffic from port 80/443 to port `<%= port || 3000 %>`.

