## 📜 4. Automated Deployment Scripts

This project includes deployment helper scripts in `scripts/`:

- Run a full build check:
  ```bash
  chmod +x scripts/build.sh
  ./scripts/build.sh
  ```

- Execute deployment:
  ```bash
  chmod +x scripts/deploy.sh
  ./scripts/deploy.sh
  ```

